rows.problem:
A market survey shows that the sales volume and price of a certain product in the past 50 days are functions of the sales time t(days), and the sales volume approximately satisfies f(t)=−2t+200(1≤t≤50,t∈N). The price for the first 30 days is g(x)=12t+30(1≤t≤30,t∈N), and for the last 20 days is g(t)=45(31≤t≤50,t∈N).
(1) Write out the daily sales S of the product as a function of time t;
(2) Find the maximum value of the daily sales S.
